  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, without the legendary Gu, judges that walking strength path when the path is a shadow of ancient glory needs at least an ancient strength path inheritance. He remembers only three: one at Eastern Seas, one at Central Continent, and this Southern Border site. Empress Wu Ji of Wu clan walked the strength path. Gu Immortals at rank six sit outside the mortal-realm count that ranks the clans.",
      "chapters": [
        281
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "path_strength",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_empress_wu_ji",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_ranks_and_realms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan leader Empress Wu Ji chose a Gu from it for Wu Ran, whose public name is Li Ran, so he could dominate Shang clan city’s battle stage, and narration calls that Gu one that possessed a legendary tale.",
      "chapters": [
        283
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "legendary-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_li_ran",
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Yang tells Fang Yuan to try exploring ancient strength path inheritances, and that Wu clan found such an inheritance several years ago.",
      "chapters": [
        286
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-find",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan already has a copy of the all-out effort Gu recipe from Li Ran. Wu clan provided Li Ran that Gu and the recipe, which only raises it from rank three to rank four.",
      "chapters": [
        286
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recipe-from-li-ran",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_all_out_effort_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the entire Southern Border only Empress Wu Ji was a successful strength path story at the peak, and even she relied on the ancient strength path inheritance to do so.",
      "chapters": [
        292
      ],
